pancake is unreleased. Its public APIs can change, it has not received a
security audit, and it should not carry data you cannot afford to lose.
[SECURITY.md](https://github.com/jimisaacs/pancake/blob/main/SECURITY.md)
defines the current security posture and the private reporting process.

# Explore the current build

- **[Start building]($link.page('start'))** installs the Zig package and makes
  a complete call, with routes to the C ABI and every binding.
- **[Choose a transport]($link.page('transports/choosing'))** compares
  identity, encryption, reachability, browser support, and interoperability.
- **[What you can depend on]($link.page('stability'))** separates recurring
  checks, on-demand evidence, and behavior that remains unverified.
- **[Performance]($link.page('performance'))** publishes throughput,
  allocation, footprint, transport, and binding measurements with their
  methods.

# Project records

The repository keeps the detailed project record: [what ships
today](https://github.com/jimisaacs/pancake/blob/main/docs/shipped.md), [known
limitations](https://github.com/jimisaacs/pancake/blob/main/docs/boundaries.md),
the [1.0 ladder](https://github.com/jimisaacs/pancake/blob/main/docs/ladder.md),
and the [remaining work](https://github.com/jimisaacs/pancake/blob/main/docs/roadmap.md).
The [vision](https://github.com/jimisaacs/pancake/blob/main/docs/vision.md)
defines the destination; accepted and superseded choices are recorded in the
[decision index](https://github.com/jimisaacs/pancake/blob/main/docs/decisions/README.md).
